{"id":"d_ex_police_12","cat":"outpost","group":{"id":"outpost10201","label":"Police Station"},"label":"The Case of the Strange Sounds","stage":null,"prev":"d_ex_police_11","next":null,"speakers":{"poli":"Poli","miranda":"Miranda","laplace_p":"Laplace"},"icons":{"poli":"si_c030_00_s","miranda":"si_c032_00_s","laplace_p":"si_c103_00_s"},"notes":["Unlock: Laplace: Ultimate Hero · Poli · Miranda","Featuring Laplace: Ultimate Hero · 1 stamina · Reward: Darling for a Day ×1"],"lines":[{"id":"d_ex_police_12_1","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_1","text":"After getting a call from Poli, I head to the police station.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Police","bgArt":"police","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_languor","movie":null,"shown":["poli","miranda"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_2","text":"Recently, we've been getting a string of similar reports.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_3","text":"People say they've been hearing strange noises all around the Outpost.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_4","text":"I-I heard it too!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_5","text":"Someone was making that noise,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_6","text":"but when I turned around to catch them, they'd already run off.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_7","text":"Right, which is why we've been getting so many complaints.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_8","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_8","text":"What kind of Nikke would go around making weird noises...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_9","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_9","text":"So you want me to help you catch the culprit?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_10","text":"Yep, that's right! Help us figure out who it is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_11","text":"First, we'll read through the complaints. If anyone comes to mind, let us know.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_12","text":"Miranda, go ahead and read them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_13","text":"\"While I was out shopping, I suddenly felt a chill.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"ShoppingMall","bgArt":"shoppingmall","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_14","text":"\"A shiver ran through my whole body. I turned around to see what it was, and that's when I heard a strange sound.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_15","text":"\"I can't remember clearly, but there were so many people, and everything was echoing, so I can't be sure,\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_16","text":"\"but I think I heard someone mention help. Maybe someone was calling for help?\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_17","text":"\"Can you check if something dangerous is going on?\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_18","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_18","text":"Help...? What could be going on at the Outpost that they'd need help...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_19","text":"There's more!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_20","text":"\"It happened while I was taking a water break after a training session at the gym.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Gym","bgArt":"gym","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_21","text":"\"Suddenly, a gust of wind blew outside, and I heard someone laughing from somewhere.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_22","text":"\"It sounded like, 'Hahaha...!'\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_23","text":"\"It's scaring our members away, so please catch whoever's responsible as soon as possible.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_24","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_24","text":"A Nikke who's asking for help... and laughing...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_25","text":"And finally, here's the latest complaint we've received!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_26","text":"\"I finished running the train for the day and was quietly singing to myself on my way home.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Station_n","bgArt":"station_n","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_27","text":"\"Singing is a hobby of mine, hehe.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_28","text":"\"Then out of nowhere, I heard a gust of wind... followed by what sounded like a battle cry?\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_29","text":"\"I think they shouted something about 'Power'?\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_30","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_30","text":"A Nikke crying for help... laughing... and shouting, \"Power!\"?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_31","text":"Those are the complaints we've received about the strange noises.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Police","bgArt":"police","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["poli","miranda"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_32","text":"Do you have any guesses as to who it might be?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_33","text":"Yeah...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_34","text":"Whoa! I knew we could count on you, Commander!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_35","text":"Then tell us! We've gotta go catch 'em right away!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_36","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_36","text":"I'll have her come over.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_37","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_37","text":"A little while later...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_38","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_38","text":"*Crash*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["laplace_p"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"la