,"text":"Looks like everyone mistook you for a ghost, zipping around and yelling like that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_68","text":"Th-then what was I supposed to do?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_69","text":"I was just out on patrol! I didn't think people would mistake me for a ghost!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_70","text":"Hmm... So you were just out on patrol, making sure there wasn't any danger?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_71","text":"Y-yeah! I was just trying to help because I'm a hero!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_72","text":"I think it's because you were running so fast while shouting.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_73","text":"Let's try not to shout so loudly from now on, okay?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_74","text":"What do you think, Commander?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_75","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_75","text":"Yeah, that sounds about right to me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_76","text":"That's all?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_77","text":"You could slow down a bit too.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_78","text":"Got it! From now on, I'll tone down the Hero Power while I'm on patrol!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_79","text":"Thanks for helping out today, Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_police_12_80","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_police_12_80","text":"I'm just glad we got it resolved.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_po